Question: I want to ask questions about a PDF handbook using a Mistral chat completion call. What setup steps do I need before writing any code, and what should my Python script check and include so the answers are grounded in my document rather than generic knowledge?
Reference answer: First set your API key as an environment variable (e.g. export MISTRAL_API_KEY=...) and pip install mistralai. Upload the PDF with purpose="retrieval", poll client.files.retrieve until the status is "processed", then call client.chat.complete passing documents=[{"type": "file", "id": file_id}] so the model retrieves relevant passages.

